{"seq":3,"slug":"grading-workflow","title":"调色流程工具","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/grading-workflow","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"node-system","title":"DaVinci Resolve 节点系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/grading-workflow/node-system","wordCount":1602,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"split-screen-reference","title":"分屏对比与参考工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/grading-workflow/split-screen-reference","wordCount":1738,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"version-management","title":"版本管理与调色协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/grading-workflow/version-management","wordCount":1536,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"调色流程工具-简介\">调色流程工具 简介</h1><p>调色流程工具（Grading Workflow）涵盖专业调色软件的核心操作范式、项目组织方法和协作机制。DaVinci Resolve 的节点系统是当今行业标准的调色架构，理解节点流程是掌握专业调色的必经之路。</p>\n<p>本章深入讲解 DaVinci Resolve 的节点系统与工作逻辑、分屏对比与参考工具的使用、以及调色版本管理与协作方法。这些知识确保调色工作既高效又可追溯。</p>\n"}